#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:802
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> - The text indicating character area."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> – Området där tecken runt textfält "
"anges."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:807
msgid ""
"Separated value files often additionally define a character used to indicate"
" the start and end of a data element which should be considered a single "
"text entry. This strategy allows the inclusion of text entries which include"
" the value separator."
msgstr ""
"Filer med avgränsade värden kan också ange ett tecken som markerar början "
"och slutet på ett värde som ska behandlas som en enda textpost. Då kan "
"textvärden innehålla själva avgränsningstecknet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:815
msgid ""
"For example, a file which is structured as a comma separated value file, "
"could use the double quotation mark to delimit text values and would then be"
" able to include text values such as: 'Zoe, Mark, Sally'."
msgstr ""
"En kommaseparerad fil kan till exempel använda dubbla citattecken runt "
"textvärden: då kan ett värde som ”Zoe, Mark, Sally” innehålla kommatecken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:825
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">3</emphasis> - The preview area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">3</emphasis> – Förhandsgranskningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:829
msgid ""
"This area displays a preview of the file as it will be interpreted when the "
"settings that are currently selected in the first and second panels are "
"applied."
msgstr ""
"Här visas en förhandsgranskning av hur filen tolkas med inställningarna i de"
" två första panelerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:838 C/gnumeric.xml:1021
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">4</emphasis> - The button area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">4</emphasis> – Knappområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:842 C/gnumeric.xml:1025
msgid ""
"These four buttons allow the user to navigate the druid. The "
"<guibutton>Help</guibutton> button should open the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> manual to this section. The "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the dialog and return the "
"user to the worksheet. The <guibutton>Back</guibutton> button will take the "
"user back to the first panel, without, however, changing the settings in "
"this second panel. The <guibutton>Forward</guibutton> button will bring up "
"the next panel in the druid."
msgstr ""
"De här fyra knapparna styr guiden. <guibutton>Hjälp</guibutton> öppnar "
"handboken för <application>Gnumeric</application> på det här avsnittet. Med "
"<guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> stänger du dialogrutan och återgår till "
"kalkylbladet. <guibutton>Tillbaka</guibutton> tar dig till den första "
"panelen utan att ändra inställningarna i den andra. Med "
"<guibutton>Framåt</guibutton> öppnar du nästa panel."
